{"availability":"available","full":"Anil-matcha/open-agent-connector","name":"open-agent-connector","description":"Open-source, self-hosted alternative to Composio, Nango, Merge.dev, and Arcade.dev for AI agent integrations. Run GitHub, Slack, Hacker News, and custom HTTP actions over MCP or REST.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":842,"forks":320,"created":"2024-06-06T12:06:51Z","updated":"2026-10-15T07:41:22Z","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["agent-tools","ai-agents","api-gateway","api-integrations","arcade-dev","composio","connector-gateway","fastapi","github","integrations","mcp","merge-dev","model-context-protocol","nango","python","rest-api","self-hosted","slack","sqlite","typescript"],"demo":"https://muapi.ai/playground/veo3-text-to-video","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T04:57:10.896Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T04:57:10.896Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T04:57:10.896Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:38:30.106Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:56.289Z","stars":835,"forks":321},{"at":"2026-10-04T19:21:17.079Z","stars":835,"forks":321},{"at":"2026-10-06T21:06:15.963Z","stars":835,"forks":321},{"at":"2026-10-09T01:07:30.727Z","stars":837,"forks":321},{"at":"2026-10-11T23:58:09.591Z","stars":838,"forks":321},{"at":"2026-10-18T04:57:10.896Z","stars":842,"forks":320}],"technologies":["Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An open-source, self-hosted integration gateway for AI agents. Connect accounts to app APIs, keep credentials in your own runtime, and let agents discover and run actions through the Model Context Protocol (MCP) or a REST API.","This project is for developers who want to inspect, run, and extend their own agent integration layer. It is an early-stage open-source option to evaluate alongside Composio, Nango, Merge.dev, and Arcade.dev. Those platforms offer broader catalogs and managed capabilities; Open Agent Connector currently prioritizes a compact self-hosted implementation that you can modify."],"features":["MCP gateway: supports JSON-RPC methods for initialization, ping, tool discovery, and tool execution over POST /mcp.","Action discovery: agents can list providers, search actions, inspect action guides and schemas, and execute actions.","Direct MCP actions: provider actions are also exposed as individual MCP tools, alongside five discovery and execution tools.","REST API: list providers and actions, execute an action, or use a provider proxy where supported.","Connections: save named provider connections; credential values are encrypted before they are stored."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anil-matcha/open-agent-connector/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c36803a2e42838a46bd1b1507dccc6754282ac1206f90ed83ef9d0182e3b6cdd","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T01:12:03.034Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T01:12:03.034Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T19:17:21Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An open-source, self-hosted integration gateway for AI agents. Connect accounts to app APIs, keep credentials in your own runtime, and let agents discover and run actions through the Model Context Protocol (MCP) or a REST API.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anil-matcha/open-agent-connector/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Those platforms offer broader catalogs and managed capabilities; Open Agent Connector currently prioritizes a compact self-hosted implementation that you can modify.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anil-matcha/open-agent-connector/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Open Agent Connector is a smaller self-hosted project for teams who want to own and extend the integration service.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anil-matcha/open-agent-connector/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"c36803a2e42838a46bd1b1507dccc6754282ac1206f90ed83ef9d0182e3b6cdd","sourceUrl":"https://github